{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Resource</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect valuable materials in the areas around you  to craft better gears, earn coins,  and slowly expand your enviornment with more functional buildings.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/ResourceGathering.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dungeon Crawling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a procedurally generated dungeon with difficult enemies, unique weapons, and valuable loot. Fight through enemies and bosses and collect resources to improve your character as you progress the dungeon.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/Dungeon.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Horde Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on waves of enemies in a chaotic environment. Survive as long as possible, defeat increasingly difficult enemies, and spend your resources wisely to strengthen your character.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/HordeLevel.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farming &amp; Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm and fish in a peaceful environment. Taking a break from combat to relax, gather resources, and manage your land at your own pace.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/FarmingAndFishing.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your character over time by enhancing stats, unlocking new abilities, and upgrading tools/weapons through anything and everything in the game, whether it\u2019s farming, fishing, material gathering or dungeon crawling. Everything contributes to growth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/SkillTree.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to grow your crops and conquer the chamber?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443250?t=1743715790","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443250?t=1743715790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/6c0192061a28414566fb13473a0612ed29e034d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743715790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/6c0192061a28414566fb13473a0612ed29e034d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743715790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Resource</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect valuable materials in the areas around you  to craft better gears, earn coins,  and slowly expand your enviornment with more functional buildings.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/ResourceGathering.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dungeon Crawling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a procedurally generated dungeon with difficult enemies, unique weapons, and valuable loot. Fight through enemies and bosses and collect resources to improve your character as you progress the dungeon.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/Dungeon.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Horde Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on waves of enemies in a chaotic environment. Survive as long as possible, defeat increasingly difficult enemies, and spend your resources wisely to strengthen your character.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/HordeLevel.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farming &amp; Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm and fish in a peaceful environment. Taking a break from combat to relax, gather resources, and manage your land at your own pace.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/FarmingAndFishing.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your character over time by enhancing stats, unlocking new abilities, and upgrading tools/weapons through anything and everything in the game, whether it\u2019s farming, fishing, material gathering or dungeon crawling. Everything contributes to growth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/SkillTree.gif?t=1743715790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to grow your crops and conquer the chamber?</strong></p>","developers":["HCFerrochrome","Kriegs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/header.jpg?t=1743715790","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Chambers & Crops","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 or AMD Athlon 64 X2 6000+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><str